   {
    "id": "a-slow-morning-at-home",
    "slug": "a-slow-morning-at-home",
    "status": "published",
    "data": {
     "title": "A Slow Morning at Home",
     "excerpt": "What I do in the first hour of the day on weekends, and why I have stopped apologizing for it.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k41",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Weekends used to start with a to-do list. Now they start with a mug, a notebook and the window open a crack.",
         "_key": "k42",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k43",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The ritual is small: put the kettle on, write three lines about what I want from the day, and wait until the coffee is finished before I look at a screen. It rarely takes more than twenty minutes, and it changes the tone of everything that follows.",
         "_key": "k44",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k45",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Three things that help",
         "_key": "k46",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "listItem": "bullet",
       "level": 1,
       "_key": "k47",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "A mug you love holding",
         "_key": "k48",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "listItem": "bullet",
       "level": 1,
       "_key": "k49",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "One notebook that lives on the kitchen counter",
         "_key": "k50",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "listItem": "bullet",
       "level": 1,
       "_key": "k51",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
